%% Collaborative edit flow: one user's change reaches the other clients.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / browser
    participant FE as Frontend SPA
    participant RPC as Backend RPC
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant MB as Redis pub/sub
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant O as Other clients

    U->>FE: edits a shape
    FE->>RPC: mutation update-file (Transit)
    RPC->>PG: persist change, bump revision
    RPC->>MB: publish file-change on file topic
    RPC-->>FE: mutation result
    MB-->>WS: deliver file-change
    WS-->>O: push change over WebSocket
    O->>O: apply change locally
